WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:07.300
On the day, Systems counts down to call, and tells crew when to leave.

2
00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:14.102
If you're running over, set the new wrap time and see what it costs.

3
00:00:14.352 --> 00:00:21.703
Ask all crew in one go. They can say I'm in, or talk to the producer.

4
00:00:21.953 --> 00:00:30.103
Then tap wrap once. Everyone's overtime is worked out at their own grade.

